@startuml
[*] --> IdentifyPatient
IdentifyPatient --> ChiefComplaint : patient details confirmed
ChiefComplaint --> HistoryTaking : chief complaint logged
HistoryTaking --> InitialAssessment : medical history recorded
InitialAssessment --> RiskAssessment : initial clinical assessment done
RiskAssessment --> PriorityDecision : risk factors evaluated
PriorityDecision --> AssignPriority : urgency level determined
AssignPriority --> [*] : priority assigned
@enduml